  DisplayName: Ice Shelf
  Description: 'Orcas only - a timed hold. Your score is the mass standing in your colour when the
    clock runs out: your trail, the fast gun''s pen strokes, and your danger shield -
    carried round the hull, then dropped where it stands for twenty seconds. A shield
    dropped in the closing seconds still counts at the whistle. Rival gunners break your
    mass, and wild herds graze it outside the core. Higher intensities bring more grazers.'
